    "reviews_summary": "Xoma Gastronómico is often praised by guests for its inviting and elegant atmosphere, deemed perfect for romantic or cozy dining, though some mention it can be a bit noisy. Service generally earns high marks for being attentive and warm, despite occasional slips in efficiency. Many diners find prices reasonable given the quality, although some say the wines are pricey. The food often receives rave reviews for its creativity and presentation, despite occasional critiques about temperature or seasoning."
